lice hiring as mayor.","pos":-0.6,"trump":-0.4,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Own regrets, look ahead","say":"Acknowledge the delayed crackdown was a regret and lay out a public safety plan.","pos":0.1,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Stay on offense","say":"Keep the ad up and argue the record shows the opponent abandoned police when needed.","pos":0.8,"trump":0.4,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Medicaid expansion","prompt":"Georgia has not fully expanded Medicaid and health costs are a central attack in the race. What is the plan?","issue":"health","src":"https://www.atlantanewsfirst.com/2026/09/17/bottoms-airs-first-true-attack-ad-linking-jackson-rigged-system/","opts":[{"label":"Full expansion","say":"Opt into full federal Medicaid expansion and repeal the grocery tax.","pos":-0.8,"trump":-0.5,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Waiver with work rules","say":"Pursue a state designed expansion waiver with work, education or training requirements.","pos":0.4,"trump":0.2,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"No expansion","say":"Reject new Medicaid spending and focus on lowering costs through competition.","pos":0.9,"trump":0.6,"tone":"calm"}]}],"debates":[{"date":"2026-10-06","where":"Georgia televised debate, host not confirmed","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/georgia-governors-race-follow-along-as-the-candidates-debate-on-tuesday/"},{"date":"2026-10-12","where":"Atlanta Press Club and GPB, Jackson absent","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/"}],"endorsements":[{"who":"Gov. Brian Kemp","for":"R","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/"},{"who":"Democratic Governors Association, 11.5 million dollars","for":"D","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/keisha-lance-bottoms-fundraising/"},{"who":"Michael Bloomberg, at least 1 million dollars","for":"D","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/keisha-lance-bottoms-fundraising/"}],"ads":[{"by":"J